{"task_id": "Mbpp/167", "solution": "```python\ndef next_power_of_2(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the smallest power of 2 greater than or equal to n.\n    Assumes n is a non-negative integer based on design context, handling 0 and 1 correctly.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return 1\n    v = n - 1\n    v |= v >> 1\n    v |= v >> 2\n    v |= v >> 4\n    v |= v >> 8\n    v |= v >> 16\n    v |= v >> 32\n    return v + 1\n```"}
