{"task_id": "Mbpp/457", "solution": "from typing import List, Any\n\ndef Find_Min(list_of_lists: List[List[Any]]) -> List[Any]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sublist with the minimum length from a list of lists.\n    Returns the first such sublist encountered.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_len = float('inf')\n    min_sublist = None\n\n    for sublist in list_of_lists:\n        current_len = len(sublist)\n        if current_len < min_len:\n            min_len = current_len\n            min_sublist = sublist\n            if min_len == 0:\n                break\n    \n    # Return a shallow copy of the found sublist to prevent external mutation.\n    return list(min_sublist)"}
